# Repository hygiene.
#
# Scope note: the site is still served as static files with no server-side
# build. The one exception is the Tailwind stylesheet, which is compiled from
# assets/tailwind-input.css by the Tailwind CLI. Its *output*
# (assets/tailwind.css) is committed on purpose so GitHub Pages can serve it
# directly; only the toolchain that produces it is ignored. Nothing else in
# this file describes a project shape that does not exist.

# Tailwind CLI toolchain. Restore with `npm install`; rebuild with
# `npm run build:css`. The compiled assets/tailwind.css is NOT ignored.
node_modules/

# Local agent configuration. Until now this was kept out of the repository only
# by a machine-local global gitignore, which is not portable to other clones.
.claude/

# Environment and secrets. Never commit these.
.env
.env.*
*.local

# Logs
*.log

# OS-generated files
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor and tooling temporaries
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.tmp
*.bak
*~
